{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39187","headline":"新正日商南道中作寄李明府 · 韦庄","name":"新正日商南道中作寄李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相看又见岁华新，依旧杨朱拭泪巾。\n踏雪偶因寻戴客，论文还比聚星人。\n嵩山不改千年色，洛邑长生一路尘。\n今日与君同避世，却怜无事是家贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}